        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="67" value="&lt;b&gt;Order agreed:&lt;/b&gt; account + IBAN are created BEFORE the loan — createLoan needs a valid T24 settlement account and the letter needs the IBAN. Sanity check: /api/T24/getIbanStatus on the new IBAN before the letter is issued." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF2CC;strokeColor=#D6B656;fontSize=9;align=left;spacing=8;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="620" y="964" width="540" height="64" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="68" value="&lt;b&gt;NSTL (toggle OFF — C1 / C3)&lt;/b&gt; · existing PL flow unchanged: repayment account — /api/T24/createLoanRepaymentAccount · productId = &lt;b&gt;REFN.CA.GEN&lt;/b&gt; → /api/T24/createLoan → DDA e-sign on the external salary IBAN → immediate disbursal (no hold, no letter)" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;fontSize=10;align=left;spacing=10;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="330" y="1056" width="1130" height="72" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="69" value="toggle OFF" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;dashed=1;exitX=0.08;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" parent="1" edge="1" source="31" target="68">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry">
            <Array as="points">
              <mxPoint x="60" y="1092"/>
            </Array>
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="70" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#B20000&quot;&gt;Open with Middleware / T24 — not found in spec v4.5&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Standing-order creation API — FSTL repayment method (INT-1) has no endpoint&lt;br&gt;• Debit-card creation for the new CASA — only NI CardDetailsEnquiry (read) exists&lt;br&gt;• Fund-hold / release mechanics — createLoan has settlement fields, no hold flag&lt;br&gt;• /api/T24/repay is Tabby-SME-scoped — retail PL repayment posting TBC&lt;br&gt;• WPS rails exist (createInwardWps / createOutwardWps) — option for salary detection" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=none;dashed=1;align=left;fontSize=9;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1520" y="1010" width="600" height="150" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
